{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/19lrxb","slideIndex":0,"text":"Two-panel revision of Figure5. Panel(a) shows concurrent meteorological inputs, training-fitted preprocessing, 32 members, 3 blocks of width256, separate regression heads, standardized prediction averaging, inverse target scaling and memberwise MSE. Panel(b) shows shared W and member-specific R/S/B followed by ReLU and training-only dropout0.1. The network is standard TabM from the supplied original paper Fig1 and local Revision031 implementation; matrices W differ across depth. The former protocol panel and displayed equation are relocated to the aligned manuscript text in this revision. All visible elements are mapped to explanatory prose in the accompanying guide. All native shapes/text/connectors remain editable; no experiments were rerun."}